## After Writing

1. Print the full file path
2. Print Candidate Learnings with ready-to-run `bobby learn` commands for user approval
3. Never auto-run `bobby learn`

If you discovered a retro-specific pattern (better heuristic, new detection strategy):
`bobby learn bobby-retro "slug" "TYPE: description"`

